       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is well above the maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg per dose \u00d7 4 = 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum for adults:** the usual single dose is 400\u2013800 mg. The maximum daily dose is 3,200 mg for prescription use under physician supervision, and 1,200 mg/day for OTC use.\n- **Risk:** this is twice the maximum daily dose. It carries a high risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nHere are some possible intended orders:\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg PO four times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm it explicitly and give your rationale. I would still suggest a pharmacy review first."
